  are the owner's sheet ruling 2026-10-05. Free RM_ tier, ONE HOME: the Abyss. Every stat, tool, race field and
  pawnkind number below is the donor's own, EXCEPT these donor-only references, which this tier may not name:
    - bite capacity AA_ToxicBite -> vanilla ToxicBite (PROVISIONAL substitute)
    - leatherDef Leather_Night -> Leather_Wolf (PROVISIONAL; the Abyss siblings' leather)
    - CompProperties_EggLayer (donor egg items) dropped: it bears live young on the donor's own
      gestationPeriodDays/litterSizeCurve
    - VEF CompProperties_InitialAbility AA_Quill (the quill throw) and the VEF stat extension dropped. The
      thrown-spine lunge in the description is OWED as our own mechanic (not built here).
    - wildBiomes dropped (one home: cast only in RM_Abyss).
  ART: abyss_sesserith_v3 (east/south/north, finished in the artpipe), installed 2026-10-06 via the art ledger at the texPath below.
