<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Sesserith</defName>
    <label>sesserith</label>
    <description>A lean, long-skulled night hunter on six spindly legs, its hide pitch black, with a row of small eyes glowing yellow down each side of its narrow head. A ridge of long, bone-white barbed spines runs from its neck to the tip of its tail; it shakes them off in a rattling spray as it lunges, and whatever they stick in, it follows down. Like all the black, many-eyed things of the Abyss, it seems less evolved than made, as if some old and patient cruelty once had the shaping of it.</description>
